  "Scenes.Aiko.AikoAggroGreeting.CoyMaybeHasty": "[pg][say: Heheh... well... you know, maybe I was hasty. Perhaps we could strike a deal? What do you say? My Ball in exchange for anything your heart desires. Riches, power... I could help take the edge off things, if you know what I mean,] she says coyly, wiggling her hips seductively."
  "Scenes.Aiko.AikoAggroGreeting.ThreatenBack": "You ask her if that was a threat, stowing the ball and readying your [weapon]. You're certain that she's trying to trick you somehow, and you won't stand for it!"
  "Scenes.Aiko.AikoApologize.ButtonSincere": "Sincere"
