  "Scenes.Aiko.AikoE1Fight.HopedToAvoidFight": "[pg][say: I was really hoping to avoid a fight,] she says, holding her hands up defensively, taking a few small steps backward. [say: But I really need that ball back, and if I can't convince you... I'll just have to force you to give it up.]"
