  "Scenes.Aiko.AikoE1Riches.ConsiderOffer": "You consider her offer for a moment, and then tell her that you could always use a few extra gems."
  "Scenes.Aiko.AikoE1Riches.CountChest": "[pg]Upon your return to camp, you set the chest down to count your newly-acquired riches, hearing a hollow thump! Wait, that's not right. Wasn't this chest a lot heavier just a little while ago? You open the chest hastily, and find that the contents have turned to a pile of leaves!"
